  "quote": "A landlord may enter a rental unit at any time without written notice",
  "reason": "Section 26(1)(a) of the Residential Tenancies Act, 2006 explicitly allows a landlord to enter a rental unit at any time without written notice in cases of emergency. Because the clause reflects the statutory right provided by the Act, it is permitted and not void."
